stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Off
    Off --> WarmingUp : press ON
    WarmingUp --> ReadyPC : ready / indicator green
    ReadyPC --> Laptop : press LAPTOP
    ReadyPC --> Off : press OFF
    Laptop --> Off : press OFF
    note right of WarmingUp
        entry / beep once
        do / blink red
    end note
    note right of ReadyPC
        Default source is PC.
    end note
